{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A turn-based strategy game where, in a world constantly invaded by the Demon Lord, you use your wisdom to compete for fame with other players and become a legendary guild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/Title-\u52a8\u6001\u53d8\u5316\u7684\u4e16\u754cEN.png?t=1744336957\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/\u52a8\u6001\u53d8\u5316\u7684\u4e16\u754c.gif?t=1744336957\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Demon Lord has a chance to invade towns every day, turning them into monster nests. This will be a challenge in your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the start of each month, all buildings on the map will randomly change. Can you make the wisest decisions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/Title-\u81ea\u7531\u7ec4\u5408\u73a9\u6cd5EN.png?t=1744336957\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/\u81ea\u7531\u7ec4\u5408\u73a9\u6cd5.gif?t=1744336957\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Management, alchemy, combat training \u2013 freely combine them. How will you defeat your opponents?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/Title-\u62db\u52df\u52c7\u8005EN.png?t=1744336957\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/\u62db\u52df\u52c7\u8005.gif?t=1744336957\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your dream team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/Title-\u6311\u9009\u5b9d\u7269EN.png?t=1744336957\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/\u6311\u9009\u5b9d\u7269.gif?t=1744336957\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Treasures with diverse effects, how do you choose the best ones?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/Title-\u70bc\u91d1EN.png?t=1744336957\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/\u70bc\u91d1.gif?t=1744336957\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse alchemy options, where risks and rewards coexist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage Properties\uff08Mischief and Profit Go Hand in Hand\uff09</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Versatile commercial buildings, how should you construct them to assist you and trap your opponents in the mud?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Badges (Boost Your Team's Strength!)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What badges await you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>And much more...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waiting for you to discover!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3646920?t=1744336957","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3646920?t=1744336957","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/843963ce6727d547f60cb44499d213abddc53e40/capsul